<text x="28" y="662" class="st">BUDGET PLANNING NOTE</text><rect class="c" x="28" y="678" width="1384" height="112" rx="13"/><text x="50" y="713" class="h3">Run Frequency Will Be Outcome-Driven</text><text x="50" y="742" class="b">The number of test runs required for each scenario is not fixed and will be determined by the results observed during execution.</text><text x="50" y="765" class="b">Additional runs may be required to validate performance improvements following tuning, remediation, or configuration changes.</text><text x="50" y="788" class="s">Accordingly, the per-run figures above should be used as the basis for budget planning, with total expenditure dependent on the number of validation cycles required.</text>
